                                "sense_id": "874342f9-b541-3cce-8325-c25dacec82d6",
                                "text": "One can see why Secundo protests making the timpano. The dish is time consuming and demands an involved preparation. It is reserved for special occasions, for it serves anywhere from ten to sixteen people. […] The food stylist for the film, Deborah Disabatino, said she felt like an architect when constructing a timpano, and […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3248dcac-7d7c-4833-a003-64a689cb7a06",
                                "sense_id": "874342f9-b541-3cce-8325-c25dacec82d6",
                                "text": "Later in the book, we'll dig deeper into the world of baked pastas like elegant lasagna timpanos and new interpretations like crunchy life-changing deep-fried bricks of lasagna[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
